# Docker only gets what a build needs. An allowlist: anything we add later,
# like another secret, stays out until we let it in.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!cmd/
!db/
!gen/
!internal/
# Tests never go into an image, and editing one shouldn't rebuild it.
**/*_test.go
**/testdata/

Git

.git .gitignore .gitattributes

Environment variables and secrets

.env .env.* !.env.example *.pem *.key *.crt *.p12 *.pfx secrets/ credentials/

Go build artifacts

bin/ dist/ build/ tmp/ *.test .out coverage/ coverage.

Go workspace

vendor/

IDE and editors

.idea/ .vscode/ *.swp *.swo *~

OS files

.DS_Store Thumbs.db

Logs

*.log logs/

Testing and benchmarks

test-results/ test-output/ k6-results/ *.prof *.pprof

Documentation

docs/ *.md !README.md

Local infrastructure data

postgres-data/ redis-data/ nats-data/ grafana-data/ prometheus-data/

Docker

docker-compose.override.yml Dockerfile.dev

Kubernetes local configuration

.kube/ kubeconfig

Temporary files

.cache/ .npm/ .yarn/ node_modules/

CI/CD

.github/

Backup files

*.bak *.backup *.old
